otal: 5\\nCovered Requirements: 4\\nUncovered Requirements: 1\\n\\n==================================\\nDEFECT INFORMATION\\n==================================\\n\\nStories: 9\\nTotal Bugs: 7\\nBug Ratio: 77.77777777777777\\n\\n==================================\\nEXPECTED ANALYSIS\\n==================================\\n\\nExplain why the deterministic release decision\\nis appropriate using only the supplied metrics.\\n\\nIdentify the most important quality risks.\\n\\nRank the recommended QA actions by priority.\\n\\nDo not calculate a new QIS.\\n\\nDo not change the supplied release decision.\\n\\nDo not invent missing metrics.\\n", "totalStories": 9, "coverageScore": 80.0, "feedbackScore": 100.0, "incidentScore": 57.14, "sonarCoverage": 72.5, "releaseDecision": "GO_WITH_RISK", "vulnerabilities": 1, "totalRequirements": 5, "coveredRequirements": 4, "uncoveredRequirements": 1}\n\nCANDIDATE_LLAMA_ANALYSIS:\n{"topRisks": [{"reason": "The defect quality ratio of 22.22% indicates a significant quality concern.", "severity": "HIGH", "dimension": "DEFECT_QUALITY"}], "managerMessage": "The release decision is based on the high confidence level and the fact that the main risk, DEFECT_QUALITY, is at a moderate level. However, the high defect quality ratio of 22.22% indicates a significant quality concern.", "priorityActions": [{"action": "Fix high-priority defects", "priority": 1, "expectedImpact": "High"}, {"action": "Improve defect quality", "priority": 2, "expectedImpact": "Medium"}, {"action": "Enhance testing and quality assurance processes", "priority": 3, "expectedImpact": "Low"}], "executiveSummary": "The deterministic release decision is appropriate due to the high confidence level of 95% and the fact that the main risk, DEFECT_QUALITY, is at a moderate level. However, the high defect quality ratio of 22.22% indicates a significant quality concern.", "releaseRationale": "The release decision is based on the high confidence level and the fact that the main risk, DE